{
  "name": "RAG-01 - Document Ingestion [Demo, Free]",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RAG-01 - Document Ingestion [Demo]\n\n**Owned By:** [your name]\n**Last Updated:** 2026-10-10\n\n**Description:**\nUpload a PDF/TXT/MD through a web form. The file is split into overlapping\nchunks, each chunk is embedded (Google gemini-embedding-001, free tier) and stored in\nSupabase (pgvector, table rag_demo_documents).\n\n**Flow Steps:**\n1. UploadDocumentForm - n8n Form Trigger with a file field\n2. IngestDocumentToSupabase - vector store (insert mode)\n   - ChunkDocumentText: recursive splitter, 800 chars, 120 overlap\n   - LoadUploadedDocument: reads the uploaded binary file, adds 'source' metadata\n   - GeminiEmbeddingsIngest: gemini-embedding-001 (3072 dims)\n\n**Before first run:**\n- Run supabase-setup-rag-demo-gemini.sql in Supabase SQL Editor\n- Replace credentials: SUPABASE_CRED_ID, GEMINI_CRED_ID\n- Verify the binary key name ('Dokumen') and the metadata expression after import (see notes in chat)\n\n**Known limitation:** uploading the same file twice stores duplicate chunks.\n\n**Dependencies:** Supabase API credential, Google Gemini (PaLM) API credential\n**Error handling:** set Error Workflow in Settings to your global error handler.\n",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "ab62bd3a-14dc-46a9-aeed-ba24857ee58e",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Upload a document to the knowledge base",
        "formDescription": "Supported: PDF, TXT, MD",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Dokumen",
              "fieldType": "file",
              "multipleFiles": false,
              "acceptFileTypes": ".pdf,.txt,.md",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6a961bbe-f8b6-43f7-a590-b0c7e8b0f345",
      "name": "UploadDocumentForm",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "REGENERATED_ON_IMPORT"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "insert",
        "tableName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "rag_demo_documents",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "rag_demo_documents"
        },
        "options": {
          "queryName": "match_rag_demo_documents"
        }
      },
      "id": "21acf04c-d4f3-4afd-afb7-42114430dfb8",
      "name": "IngestDocumentToSupabase",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreSupabase",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000,
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "SUPABASE_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "dataType": "binary",
        "binaryDataKey": "Dokumen",
        "textSplittingMode": "custom",
        "options": {
          "metadata": {
            "metadataValues": [
              {
                "name": "source",
                "value": "={{ $binary.Dokumen.fileName }}"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "081a1c3c-7368-4b73-aa3f-b7fba30dd0c1",
      "name": "LoadUploadedDocument",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.documentDefaultDataLoader",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        400,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chunkSize": 800,
        "chunkOverlap": 120,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7df2c056-f04f-493f-aa06-d43211c38cf1",
      "name": "ChunkDocumentText",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.textSplitterRecursiveCharacterTextSplitter",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        420,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-embedding-001"
      },
      "id": "15258091-757d-4525-ba25-7345b7f131e7",
      "name": "GeminiEmbeddingsIngest",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.embeddingsGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        220
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000,
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "GEMINI_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "connections": {
